d_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},{"login":"d-uspenskiy","id":47734295,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzM0Mjk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47734295?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy","html_url":"https://github.com/d-uspenskiy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-uspenskiy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2020-01-09T17:45:11Z","updated_at":"2020-01-21T21:41:24Z","closed_at":"2020-01-21T21:41:24Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"There is a bug in processing WHERE clause in cases where ordering of columns in CREATE TABLE does not match PK order:\r\n```\r\n=> CREATE TABLE test (id1 BIGINT, date DATE, id2 BIGINT, id3 INT, value JSONB, PRIMARY KEY(id1 HASH, id3 ASC, date ASC, id2 DESC));\r\nCREATE TABLE\r\n=> INSERT INTO test (id1, date, id2, id3, value) VALUES ('1370897702011691382', '20190101', '0', '1', '\"val\"');\r\nINSERT 0 1\r\n=> SELECT * FROM test;\r\n         id1         |    date    | id2 | id3 | value\r\n---------------------+------------+-----+-----+-------\r\n 1370897702011691382 | 2019-01-01 |   0 |   1 | \"val\"\r\n(1 row)\r\n=> SELECT * FROM test WHERE id1='1370897702011691382';\r\n         id1         |    date    | id2 | id3 | value\r\n---------------------+------------+-----+-----+-------\r\n 1370897702011691382 | 2019-01-01 |   0 |   1 | \"val\"\r\n(1 row)\r\n=> SELECT * FROM test WHERE id3='1';\r\n         id1         |    date    | id2 | id3 | value\r\n---------------------+------------+-----+-----+-------\r\n 1370897702011691382 | 2019-01-01 |   0 |   1 | \"val\"\r\n(1 row)\r\n=> SELECT * FROM test WHERE id2='0';\r\n         id1         |    date    | id2 | id3 | value\r\n---------------------+------------+-----+-----+-------\r\n 1370897702011691382 | 2019-01-01 |   0 |   1 | \"val\"\r\n(1 row)\r\n=> SELECT * FROM test WHERE id1='1370897702011691382' AND id3='1' AND id2='0';\r\n id1 | date | id2 | id3 | value\r\n-----+------+-----+-----+-------\r\n(0 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis happens because we push down WHERE condition on `id3` with column ID `3` (instead of `1`).","closed_by":{"login":"nocaway","id":31016169,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDE2MTY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31016169?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway","html_url":"https://github.com/nocaway","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nocaway/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":